        "exact_excerpt": " More specifically, the corsairs acted as follows:\nDuring the winter months, from mid-December until March or, according to another source (Deloffre and\nRougeot 1976, 233), until the end of April, they retreated to islands of the southern Aegean, where no Ottomans resided, mainly Melos, Kimolos, Paros, Antiparos, Ios and Astypalaia (Fig.",
